pplicationName}]よりNoshowの通知です。\n\n以下の予約のNoshowが完了しましたのでお知らせ致します。\n{managerCanceledDescription}\nまたのご利用お待ちしております。\n\n\n■予約施設情報－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■予約内容－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n受付日時：　{reservationDateTime}\n予約番号：　{code}\n宿泊者名：  {MainUserName}\n\nチェックイン日　：　{CheckInDate}　より {RestNumber}泊\nチェックイン時刻     :  {CheckInTime}\nチェックアウト日：　{CheckOutDate}\nチェックアウト時刻  :  {CheckOutTime}\n部屋数　　　　　：　{RoomNumber}部屋\n合計人数　　　　：　{TotalPersons}名\n大人　　　　　　：男性({1stRestMaleNumber})名　女性({1stRestFemaleNumber})名\n子供・幼児　　　：　{1stRestChildNumber}名\n部屋タイプ　　　：　{RoomGroupName}\nプラン名　　　　：　{PlanName}\n\n■予約明細－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■精算情報－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※本メールアドレスは送信専用です。ご返信頂きましても、対応しかねます。\n\nオンラインからの予約操作に関しては「ユーザー管理画面」よりご確認下さい\n<a href={UserUrl}>{UserUrl}</a>\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}]予約Noshow 予約番号:{code}"}, "Io10015TemplateFormat": {"Body": "{ReserverName} 様\n[{applicationName}]よりNoshowの通知です。\n\n以下の予約のNoshowが完了しましたのでお知らせ致します。\n{managerCanceledDescription}\n\nまたのご利用お待ちしております。\n\n\n■予約施設情報－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■予約内容－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n受付日時：　{reservationDateTime}\n予約番号：　{code}\n宿泊者名：  {MainUserName}\n\nチェックイン日　：　{CheckInDate}　より {RestNumber}泊\nチェックイン時刻     :  {CheckInTime}\nチェックアウト日：　{CheckOutDate}\nチェックアウト時刻  :  {CheckOutTime}\n部屋数　　　　　：　{RoomNumber}部屋\n合計人数　　　　：　{TotalPersons}名\n大人　　　　　　：男性({1stRestMaleNumber})名　女性({1stRestFemaleNumber})名\n子供・幼児　　　：　{1stRestChildNumber}名\n部屋タイプ　　　：　{RoomGroupName}\nプラン名　　　　：　{PlanName}\n\n■予約明細－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■精算情報－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※本メールアドレスは送信専用です。ご返信頂きましても、対応しかねます。\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}]予約Noshow 予約番号:{code}"}, "Io10101TemplateFormat": {"Body": "{ReserverName} 様\n\n{applicationName}よりご宿泊に関するリマインダ通知です。\n\n以下の予約に関して、{dayLeft}日前となりましたのでご連絡差し上げます。\n\n{facilityName}スタッフ一同、{ReserverName}様のお越しを心よりお待ち申し上げております。\n道中くれぐれもお気を付けて、ごゆるりといらしてください。\n\n重ねて、数ある中から{facilityName}をお選びいただきまして誠にありがとうございます。\n\n\nご予約確認、変更、キャンセルについては「ユーザー管理画面」より行うことができます。\n尚、予約日{cancelPeriod}日前を過ぎますとキャンセル料が発生いたしますのでご了承ください。\n\n<a href={UserUrl}>{UserUrl}</a>\n\n■予約施設情報－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■予約内容－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n受付日時：　{reservationDateTime}\n予約番号：　{code}\n宿泊者名：  {MainUserName}\n\nチェックイン日　：　{CheckInDate}　より {RestNumber}泊\nチェックイン時刻     :  {CheckInTime}\nチェックアウト日：　{CheckOutDate}\nチェックアウト時刻  :  {CheckOutTime}\n部屋数　　　　　：　{RoomNumber}部屋\n合計人数　　　　：　{TotalPersons}名\n大人　　　　　　：男性({1stRestMaleNumber})名　女性({1stRestFemaleNumber})名\n子供・幼児　　　：　{1stRestChildNumber}名\n部屋タイプ　　　：　{RoomGroupName}\nプラン名　　　　：　{PlanName}\n\n■予約明細－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■精算情報－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※本メールアドレスは送信専用です。ご返信頂きましても、対応しかねます。\n\nオンラインからの予約操作に関しては「ユーザー管理画面」よりご確認下さい\n<a href={UserUrl}>{UserUrl}</a>\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}]予約リマインダ 予約番号:{code}"}, "Io10102TemplateFormat": {"Body": "{ReserverName} 様\n\n{applicationName}よりキャンセル料発生に関するリマインダ通知です。\n\n以下の予約に関して、予約日{cancelPeriod}日前となりましたので、キャンセル料発生のご連絡差し上げます。\n\n\nご予約確認、変更、キャンセルについては「ユーザー管理画面」より行うことができます。\n\n<a href={UserUrl}>{UserUrl}</a>\n\n■予約施設情報－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■予約内容－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n受付日時：　{reservationDateTime}\n予約番号：　{code}\n宿泊者名：  {MainUserName}\n\nチェックイン日　：　{CheckInDate}　より {RestNumber}泊\nチェックイン時刻     :  {CheckInTime}\nチェックアウト日：　{CheckOutDate}\nチェックアウト時刻  :  {CheckOutTime}\n部屋数　　　　　：　{RoomNumber}部屋\n合計人数　　　　：　{TotalPersons}名\n大人　　　　　　：男性({1stRestMaleNumber})名　女性({1stRestFemaleNumber})名\n子供・幼児　　　：　{1stRestChildNumber}名\n部屋タイプ　　　：　{RoomGroupName}\nプラン名　　　　：　{PlanName}\n\n■予約明細－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■精算情報－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※本メールアドレスは送信専用です。ご返信頂きましても、対応しかねます。\n\nオンラインからの予約操作に関しては「ユーザー管理画面」よりご確認下さい\n<a href={UserUrl}>{UserUrl}</a>\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊\n", "Subject": "[{facilityName}]キャンセル料発生リマインダ 予約番号:{code}"}, "Io10103TemplateFormat": {"Body": "{ReserverName} 様\n\n{applicationName}よりご宿泊に関するリマインダ通知です。\n\n以下の予約に関して、{dayLeft}日前となりましたのでご連絡差し上げます。\n\n{facilityName}スタッフ一同、{ReserverName}様のお越しを心よりお待ち申し上げております。\n道中くれぐれもお気を付けて、ごゆるりといらしてください。\n\n重ねて、数ある中から{facilityName}をお選びいただきまして誠にありがとうございます。\n\n\nご予約確認、変更、キャンセルについては以下リンクより行うことができます。\n尚、予約日{cancelPeriod}日前を過ぎますとキャンセル料が発生いたしますのでご了承ください。\n\n<a href={reservationDetailURL}>{reservationDetailURL}</a>\n\n■予約施設情報－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■予約内容－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n受付日時：　{reservationDateTime}\n予約番号：　{code}\n宿泊者名：  {MainUserName}\n\nチェックイン日　：　{CheckInDate}　より {RestNumber}泊\nチェックイン時刻     :  {CheckInTime}\nチェックアウト日：　{CheckOutDate}\nチェックアウト時刻  :  {CheckOutTime}\n部屋数　　　　　：　{RoomNumber}部屋\n合計人数　　　　：　{TotalPersons}名\n大人　　　　　　：男性({1stRestMaleNumber})名　女性({1stRestFemaleNumber})名\n子供・幼児　　　：　{1stRestChildNumber}名\n部屋タイプ　　　：　{RoomGroupName}\nプラン名　　　　：　{PlanName}\n\n■予約明細－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■精算情報－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※本メールアドレスは送信専用です。ご返信頂きましても、対応しかねます。\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}]予約リマインダ 予約番号:{code}"}, "Io10104TemplateFormat": {"Body": "{ReserverName} 様\n\n{applicationName}よりキャンセル料発生に関するリマインダ通知です。\n\n以下の予約に関して、予約日{cancelPeriod}日前となりましたので、キャンセル料発生のご連絡差し上げます。\n\n\nご予約確認、変更、キャンセルについては以下リンクより行うことができます。\n\n<a href={reservationDetailURL}>{reservationDetailURL}</a>\n\n■予約施設情報－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■予約内容－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n受付日時：　{reservationDateTime}\n予約番号：　{code}\n宿泊者名：  {MainUserName}\n\nチェックイン日　：　{CheckInDate}　より {RestNumber}泊\nチェックイン時刻     :  {CheckInTime}\nチェックアウト日：　{CheckOutDate}\nチェックアウト時刻  :  {CheckOutTime}\n部屋数　　　　　：　{RoomNumber}部屋\n合計人数　　　　：　{TotalPersons}名\n大人　　　　　　：男性({1stRestMaleNumber})名　女性({1stRestFemaleNumber})名\n子供・幼児　　　：　{1stRestChildNumber}名\n部屋タイプ　　　：　{RoomGroupName}\nプラン名　　　　：　{PlanName}\n\n■予約明細－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■精算情報－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※本メールアドレスは送信専用です。ご返信頂きましても、対応しかねます。\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}]キャンセル料発生リマインダ 予約番号:{code}"}, "Io10201TemplateFormat": {"Url": "", "Body": "", "Subject": ""}, "Io10202TemplateFormat": {"Body": "", "Subject": ""}, "Io10203TemplateFormat": {"Body": "", "Subject": ""}, "Io10204TemplateFormat": {"Url": "", "Body": "*", "Subject": "*"}, "Io10205TemplateFormat": {"Body": "*", "Subject": "*"}, "Io10206TemplateFormat": {"Body": "", "Subject": ""}, "Io10207TemplateFormat": {"Url": "", "Body": "", "Subject": ""}, "Io20001TemplateFormat": {"Body": "", "Subject": ""}, "Io20002TemplateFormat": {"Body": "", "Subject": ""}, "Io20003TemplateFormat": {"Body": "", "Subject": ""}, "Io20004TemplateFormat": {"Body": "", "Subject": ""}, "Io30001TemplateFormat": {"Body": "", "Subject": ""}, "Io30002TemplateFormat": {"Body": "", "Subject": ""}, "Io30003TemplateFormat": {"Body": "", "Subject": ""}, "Io10001EnTemplateFormat": {"Url": "", "Body": "Thank you for making a reservation at {facilityName}. \n\nPlease follow the URL below to complete the reservation process.\n*Please note that the reservation has not been confirmed yet.\n\n<a href={url}>{url}</a>\n\n※1. Please click the above URL only once.\n※2. By clicking this URL, we will check the availability of the reservation at that time. If the reservation cannot be made, we kindly ask you to start the process from the beginning.\n※3. If you are not familiar with this reservation process, please do not click the URL. After a certain period, the entered details and email address will be discarded.\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※This email address is for reservation purposes only. We cannot respond to replies. Please direct any inquiries related to your stay to the accommodation facility.\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}] Reservation Confirmation - Reservation Number: {code}"}, "Io10004EnTemplateFormat": {"Body": "Dear {ReserverName},\n\nThank you for booking your stay at ‘{facilityName}’.\nYour reservation has been completed with the following details:\n\n■ Facility Information－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■ Reservation Details－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\nReception Date: {reservationDateTime}\nReservation Number: {code}\nGuest Name: {MainUserName}\nCheck-in Date: {CheckInDate} for {RestNumber} nights\nCheck-in Time: {CheckInTime}\nCheck-out Date: {CheckOutDate}\nCheck-out Time: {CheckOutTime}\nNumber of Rooms: {RoomNumber}\nTotal Guests: {TotalPersons}\nAdults: {1stRestMaleNumber} male(s), {1stRestFemaleNumber} female(s)\nChildren/Infants: {1stRestChildNumber}\nRoom Type: {RoomGroupName}\nPlan Name: {PlanName}\n\n■ Reservation Details－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■ Payment Information－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n■ Access－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityAddress}\n\n\n■ Cancellation Policy－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{cancellationDaysBeforeFee}\n\n■ Reservation Change and Cancellation－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\nFor any changes or cancellations to your reservation, please visit 【My Page】.\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※This email address is for reservation purposes only. We are unable to respond to replies.\nFor any inquiries about your stay, please contact the facility directly.\n\nFor online reservation management, please check your “User Management Page” at\n{userUrl}\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}] Reservation Confirmation - Reservation Number: {code}"}, "Io10006EnTemplateFormat": {"Body": "Dear {ReserverName},\n\nThis is a cancellation notification from [{applicationName}].\nThe following reservation has been successfully canceled.\n{managerCanceledDescription}\nWe look forward to serving you again in the future.\n\n■ Reservation Facility Information－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■ Reservation Details－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n\nReception Date & Time: {reservationDateTime}\nReservation Number: {code}\nGuest Name: {MainUserName}\n\nCheck-in Date: {CheckInDate} for {RestNumber} night(s)\nCheck-in Time: {CheckInTime}\nCheck-out Date: {CheckOutDate}\nCheck-out Time: {CheckOutTime}\nNumber of Rooms: {RoomNumber} room(s)\nTotal Number of Guests: {TotalPersons} persons\nAdults: Male ({1stRestMaleNumber}) / Female ({1stRestFemaleNumber})\nChildren & Infants: {1stRestChildNumber} persons\nRoom Type: {RoomGroupName}\nPlan Name: {PlanName}\n\n■ Reservation Details－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■ Payment Information－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊\n[{applicationName}]\n※ This email address is for notification purposes only. Replies will not be received.\n\nFor reservation operations online, please check the User Management Page:\n{UserUrl}\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}] Reservation Cancellation - Reservation Number: {code}"}, "Io10008EnTemplateFormat": {"Body": "Dear {ReserverName},\nThis is a notification from [{applicationName}] regarding your reservation change.\n\nWe would like to inform you that the following reservation modification has been successfully completed.  \n{managerEditedDescription} \n\n■ Reservation Facility Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－  \n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－Reception Date & Time: {reservationDateTime}\nReservation Number: {code}\nGuest Name: {MainUserName} \n\nCheck-in Date: {CheckInDate} for {RestNumber} night(s)\nCheck-in Time: {CheckInTime}\nCheck-out Date: {CheckOutDate}\nCheck-out Time: {CheckOutTime}\nNumber of Rooms: {RoomNumber} room(s)\nTotal Guests: {TotalPersons} persons\nAdults: Male ({1stRestMaleNumber}) / Female ({1stRestFemaleNumber})\nChildren/Infants: {1stRestChildNumber} persons\nRoom Type: {RoomGroupName}\nPlan Name: {PlanName}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■ Payment Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※ This email address is for sending only. Please note that we are unable to respond to replies.\n\nFor online reservation management, please check the \"User Management Page\".\n{UserUrl}\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}] Reservation Change Notification - Reservation Number: {code}"}, "Io10010EnTemplateFormat": {"Body": "Dear {ReserverName},\n\nThis is a notification from [{applicationName}] regarding your reservation change.\n\nThe modification of your reservation has been successfully completed.\n{managerEditedDescription}\n\n■ Reservation Facility Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\nReception Date & Time: {reservationDateTime}\nReservation Number: {code}\nGuest Name: {MainUserName}\n\nCheck-in Date: {CheckInDate}, {RestNumber} night(s)\nCheck-in Time: {CheckInTime}\nCheck-out Date: {CheckOutDate}\nCheck-out Time: {CheckOutTime}\nNumber of Rooms: {RoomNumber} room(s)\nTotal Number of Guests: {TotalPersons} persons\nAdults: Male ({1stRestMaleNumber}) / Female ({1stRestFemaleNumber})\nChildren & Infants: {1stRestChildNumber}\nRoom Type: {RoomGroupName}\nPlan Name: {PlanName}\n\n■ Reservation Breakdown －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■ Payment Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n■ Reservation Confirmation, Modification, and Cancellation Procedures －－－－－－－－－－－\nFor confirmation, modification, or cancellation of this reservation, please proceed via the following link:\n<a href={reservationDetailURL}>{reservationDetailURL}</a>\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※ This email address is for outgoing messages only. Please note that replies will not be handled.\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}] Reservation Change Confirmation - Reservation Number: {code}"}, "Io10011EnTemplateFormat": {"Body": "Dear {ReserverName},\n\nThis is a cancellation notification from [{applicationName}].\n\nThe cancellation process for the following reservation has been completed.\n{managerCanceledDescription}\n\nWe look forward to serving you again in the future.\n\n■ Reservation Facility Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\nReception Date and Time: {reservationDateTime}\nReservation Number: {code}\nGuest Name: {MainUserName}\nCheck-in Date: {CheckInDate}, {RestNumber} nights\nCheck-in Time: {CheckInTime}\nCheck-out Date: {CheckOutDate}\nCheck-out Time: {CheckOutTime}\nNumber of Rooms: {RoomNumber} rooms\nTotal Guests: {TotalPersons} people\nAdults: Male ({1stRestMaleNumber}) Female ({1stRestFemaleNumber})\nChildren/Infants: {1stRestChildNumber}\nRoom Type: {RoomGroupName}\nPlan Name: {PlanName}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■ Payment Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※ This email address is for sending only. Replies to this email will not be received.\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}] Reservation Cancellation - Reservation Number: {code}"}, "Io10012EnTemplateFormat": {"Body": "Dear {ReserverName},\n\nThank you for booking with {facilityName}.\n\nYour reservation has been successfully completed with the following details:\n\n■ Reservation Facility Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\nBooking Date & Time: {reservationDateTime}\nReservation Number: {code}\nGuest Name: {MainUserName}\nCheck-in Date: {CheckInDate} for {RestNumber} night(s)\nCheck-in Time: {CheckInTime}\nCheck-out Date: {CheckOutDate}\nCheck-out Time: {CheckOutTime}\nNumber of Rooms: {RoomNumber} room(s)\nTotal Guests: {TotalPersons} people\nAdults: Male ({1stRestMaleNumber}) / Female ({1stRestFemaleNumber})\nChildren & Infants: {1stRestChildNumber}\nRoom Type: {RoomGroupName}\nPlan Name: {PlanName}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■ Payment Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n■ Access －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityAddress}\n\n\n■ Cancellation Policy －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n[Cancellation Policy (Based on the plan at the time of booking)]\n{cancellingDescription}\n\n■ Reservation Confirmation, Modification, and Cancellation Procedures －－－－－－－－－－－\nTo confirm, modify, or cancel your reservation, please proceed via the link below:\n<a href={reservationDetailURL}>{reservationDetailURL}</a>\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※ This email address is for reservation purposes only. Replies to this email will not be processed.\nFor inquiries regarding your stay, please contact the accommodation directly.\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}] Reservation Confirmation - Reservation Number: {code}"}, "Io10014EnTemplateFormat": {"Body": "Dear {ReserverName},\n\nThis is a Noshow notification from [{applicationName}].\nThe following reservation has been successfully noshow.\n{managerCanceledDescription}\nWe look forward to serving you again in the future.\n\n■ Reservation Facility Information－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■ Reservation Details－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n\nReception Date & Time: {reservationDateTime}\nReservation Number: {code}\nGuest Name: {MainUserName}\n\nCheck-in Date: {CheckInDate} for {RestNumber} night(s)\nCheck-in Time: {CheckInTime}\nCheck-out Date: {CheckOutDate}\nCheck-out Time: {CheckOutTime}\nNumber of Rooms: {RoomNumber} room(s)\nTotal Number of Guests: {TotalPersons} persons\nAdults: Male ({1stRestMaleNumber}) / Female ({1stRestFemaleNumber})\nChildren & Infants: {1stRestChildNumber} persons\nRoom Type: {RoomGroupName}\nPlan Name: {PlanName}\n\n■ Reservation Details－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■ Payment Information－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊\n[{applicationName}]\n※ This email address is for notification purposes only. Replies will not be received.\n\nFor reservation operations online, please check the User Management Page:\n{UserUrl}\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}] Reservation Noshow - Reservation Number: {code}"}, "Io10015EnTemplateFormat": {"Body": "Dear {ReserverName},\n\nThis is a Noshow notification from [{applicationName}].\n\nThe Noshow process for the following reservation has been completed.\n{managerCanceledDescription}\n\nWe look forward to serving you again in the future.\n\n■ Reservation Facility Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\nReception Date and Time: {reservationDateTime}\nReservation Number: {code}\nGuest Name: {MainUserName}\nCheck-in Date: {CheckInDate}, {RestNumber} nights\nCheck-in Time: {CheckInTime}\nCheck-out Date: {CheckOutDate}\nCheck-out Time: {CheckOutTime}\nNumber of Rooms: {RoomNumber} rooms\nTotal Guests: {TotalPersons} people\nAdults: Male ({1stRestMaleNumber}) Female ({1stRestFemaleNumber})\nChildren/Infants: {1stRestChildNumber}\nRoom Type: {RoomGroupName}\nPlan Name: {PlanName}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■ Payment Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※ This email address is for sending only. Replies to this email will not be received.\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}] Reservation Noshow - Reservation Number: {code}"}, "Io10101EnTemplateFormat": {"Body": "{ReserverName},\n\nThis is a reminder notification from {applicationName} regarding your upcoming stay.\n\nYour reservation is now {dayLeft} days away.\nAll the staff at {facilityName} are looking forward to welcoming you, {ReserverName}.\nPlease have a safe journey and enjoy your stay.\n\nOnce again, thank you very much for choosing {facilityName} among many options.\n\nYou can check, modify, or cancel your reservation through the \"User Management Screen.\"\nPlease note that cancellation fees may apply if the cancellation is made after {cancelPeriod} days before the check-in date.\n{UserUrl}\n\n■ Reservation Facility Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\nReception Date & Time: {reservationDateTime}\nReservation Number: {code}\nGuest Name: {MainUserName}\nCheck-in Date: {CheckInDate} for {RestNumber} nights\nCheck-in Time: {CheckInTime}\nCheck-out Date: {CheckOutDate}\nCheck-out Time: {CheckOutTime}\nNumber of Rooms: {RoomNumber} rooms\nTotal Guests: {TotalPersons} persons\nAdults: Male ({1stRestMaleNumber}) / Female ({1stRestFemaleNumber})\nChildren & Infants: {1stRestChildNumber} persons\nRoom Type: {RoomGroupName}\nPlan Name: {PlanName}\n\n■ Reservation Breakdown －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■ Payment Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊ [{applicationName}]\n※This email address is for sending only. Replies will not be processed.\nFor online reservation management, please visit the \"User Management Screen\":\n{UserUrl}\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}] Reservation Reminder - Reservation Number: {code}"}, "Io10102EnTemplateFormat": {"Body": "Dear {ReserverName},\n\nThis is a reminder notification from {applicationName} regarding the occurrence of a cancellation fee.\n\nFor the following reservation, it is now {cancelPeriod} days before the check-in date, and a cancellation fee will be incurred.\nYou can check, modify, or cancel your reservation from the \"User Management Page.\"\n{UserUrl}\n\n■ Reservation Facility Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\nBooking Date & Time: {reservationDateTime}\nReservation Number: {code}\nGuest Name: {MainUserName}\nCheck-in Date: {CheckInDate} for {RestNumber} night(s)\nCheck-in Time: {CheckInTime}\nCheck-out Date: {CheckOutDate}\nCheck-out Time: {CheckOutTime}\nNumber of Rooms: {RoomNumber} room(s)\nTotal Number of Guests: {TotalPersons} people\nAdults: Male ({1stRestMaleNumber}) / Female ({1stRestFemaleNumber})\nChildren & Infants: {1stRestChildNumber} person(s)\nRoom Type: {RoomGroupName}\nPlan Name: {PlanName}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■ Payment Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊ [{applicationName}]\n※ This email address is for sending only. Please note that we cannot respond to any replies.\nFor online reservation operations, please check the \"User Management Page\" at the link below:\n{UserUrl}\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}] Cancellation Fee Reminder - Reservation Number: {code}"}, "Io10103EnTemplateFormat": {"Body": "Dear {ReserverName},\n\nThis is a reminder notification from {applicationName} regarding your upcoming stay.\nYour reservation is approaching in {dayLeft} days, so we would like to remind you.\n\nAll of us at {facilityName} are looking forward to welcoming you.\nPlease take care on your journey and have a relaxing stay.\nOnce again, we sincerely appreciate you choosing {facilityName} among many options.\n\nYou can check, modify, or cancel your reservation via the link below.\nPlease note that a cancellation fee will be charged if you cancel after {cancelPeriod} days before the reservation date.\n{reservationDetailURL}\n\n■ Reservation Facility Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}  \n{facilityAddress}  \n{facilityTel}  \n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－  \nBooking Date & Time: {reservationDateTime}  \nReservation Number: {code}  \nGuest Name: {MainUserName}  \nCheck-in Date: {CheckInDate}, {RestNumber} nights  \nCheck-in Time: {CheckInTime}  \nCheck-out Date: {CheckOutDate}  \nCheck-out Time: {CheckOutTime}  \nNumber of Rooms: {RoomNumber}  \nTotal Guests: {TotalPersons}  \nAdults: Male ({1stRestMaleNumber}), Female ({1stRestFemaleNumber})  \nChildren/Infants: {1stRestChildNumber}  \nRoom Type: {RoomGroupName}  \nPlan Name: {PlanName}  \n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－  \n{reservationDetail}  \n\n■ Payment Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－  \n{payOff}  \n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]  \n※ This email address is for outgoing messages only. Replies will not be handled.  \n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}] Reservation Reminder - Reservation Number: {code}"}, "Io10104EnTemplateFormat": {"Body": "Dear {ReserverName},\n\nThis is a cancellation fee reminder notification from {applicationName}.\n\nYour reservation below is {cancelPeriod} days away, and we would like to inform you that a cancellation fee will be applied if canceled.\nYou can check, modify, or cancel your reservation via the link below:\n{reservationDetailURL}\n\n■ Reservation Facility Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{facilityName}\n{facilityAddress}\n{facilityTel}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\nReservation Date & Time: {reservationDateTime}\nReservation Number: {code}\nGuest Name: {MainUserName}\nCheck-in Date: {CheckInDate} for {RestNumber} nights\nCheck-in Time: {CheckInTime}\nCheck-out Date: {CheckOutDate}\nCheck-out Time: {CheckOutTime}\nNumber of Rooms: {RoomNumber} rooms\nTotal Number of Guests: {TotalPersons} guests\nAdults: Male ({1stRestMaleNumber}) / Female ({1stRestFemaleNumber})\nChildren & Infants: {1stRestChildNumber} guests\nRoom Type: {RoomGroupName}\nPlan Name: {PlanName}\n\n■ Reservation Details －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{reservationDetail}\n\n■ Payment Information －－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－\n{payOff}\n\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊[{applicationName}]\n※ This email address is for sending only. Please note that replies cannot be processed.\n＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊＊", "Subject": "[{facilityName}] Cancellation Fee Reminder - Reservation Number: {code}"}}'
WHERE "is_deleted" = FALSE;

